     Function ddwwaarrff__ggeett__ffddee__aatt__ppcc() can fail with:

     [DW_DLE_ARGUMENT]  One of the arguments _f_d_e_l_i_s_t, _r_e_t___f_d_e, _l_o_p_c, or _h_i_p_c
                        was NULL.

     [DW_DLE_NO_ENTRY]  These was no FDE descriptor covering the address spec‐
                        ified by argument _p_c.

